cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TESSERA in your research, please cite this repository and the accompanying paper (citation pending publication)."
title: "TESSERA: Tumour Embeddings via Self-Supervised Encoding and Reconstruction of Alterations"
abstract: "A self-supervised foundation model for the cancer genome, jointly pretrained on somatic single-nucleotide variants and copy-number alterations from the TCGA Pan-Cancer Atlas through masked-token reconstruction within each modality and an InfoNCE contrastive objective across modalities."
type: software
